<http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85118629> <http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#note> "Here are entered collections and discussions of science fiction as realized in various media, including films, television, comic strips, etc., as well as works limited to fiction in the literary sense. Works dealing with science fiction as realized in a specific non-literary medium are entered under the specific heading, e.g. [Science fiction films.]" .
